坂大河をお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Marchen_mozuku/works/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/beeee0ae/uploads/origins/69507088-c447-438e-a8a2-31161714952a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe731c70091d7ec486b6fbefebef68ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/beeee0ae/uploads/origins/69507088-c447-438e-a8a2-31161714952a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe731c70091d7ec486b6fbefebef68ce, https://si.imgix.net/beeee0ae/uploads/origins/69507088-c447-438e-a8a2-31161714952a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5dbb4d9c2581ee4fa030a69fa3c8e9e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/beeee0ae/uploads/origins/69507088-c447-438e-a8a2-31161714952a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=027fcc56f468ce92f178a6677d5b8f91 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\nスクフェスに登場していたラクシャータというキャラのイラストを描いて欲しいです。\n衣装は資料URL参照、描写範囲は腰から上でお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://llsif.gamedbs.jp/images/gcard/120n.jpg?1539587257", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Marchen_mozuku/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/823f9cae/uploads/origins/ffe344bf-95b4-4368-8993-996209174aac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2764d32a3e5d2d40f3dbeb65c7c7bdff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/823f9cae/uploads/origins/ffe344bf-95b4-4368-8993-996209174aac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2764d32a3e5d2d40f3dbeb65c7c7bdff, https://si.imgix.net/823f9cae/uploads/origins/ffe344bf-95b4-4368-8993-996209174aac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17df378c47905bc2e3d9eb3773c0f7bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/823f9cae/uploads/origins/ffe344bf-95b4-4368-8993-996209174aac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e39e2a75943d490d3ff5b40605e5ee39 3x", "genre": "a